# A sample for the checks (never used by GitHub): the last matching line wins.
*                         @studybuddy/everyone
*.md                      @studybuddy/docs
/AGENTS.md                @studybuddy/platform
/.github/                 @studybuddy/platform
/packages/cli/            @studybuddy/cli-team
/packages/portal/         @studybuddy/portal-team
packages/portal/*.md      @studybuddy/portal-team @studybuddy/docs
/scripts/check-*.mjs      @studybuddy/platform   # the gate
/packages/planner/vendor/
docs/*                    @studybuddy/writers
